<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <style>
    body { background:#000; font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif; color:#fff; margin:0; padding:0; }
    .wrap { max-width:560px; margin:0 auto; padding:40px 24px; }
    .logo { font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif; font-size:2rem; color:#afff2d; letter-spacing:.04em; margin-bottom:32px; }
    .card { background:#0a0a0a; border:1px solid #1e1e1e; border-radius:16px; padding:28px; margin-bottom:24px; }
    .title { font-size:1.25rem; font-weight:700; color:#fff; margin-bottom:8px; }
    .sub { font-size:.875rem; color:#555; line-height:1.6; margin-bottom:20px; }
    .detail-row { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; padding:10px 0; border-bottom:1px solid #111; font-size:.875rem; }
    .detail-row:last-child { border-bottom:none; }
    .detail-label { color:#444; }
    .detail-value { color:#fff; font-weight:500; }
    .reason-box { background:#111; border:1px solid #1e1e1e; border-radius:8px; padding:14px; margin-top:16px; font-size:.875rem; color:#888; line-height:1.5; }
    .reason-label { font-size:.68rem; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:.12em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#333; margin-bottom:6px; }
    .footer { font-size:.75rem; color:#222; text-align:center; margin-top:32px; line-height:1.6; }
    .cta { display:inline-block; background:#afff2d; color:#000; border-radius:100px; padding:12px 28px; font-weight:700; font-size:.875rem; text-decoration:none; margin-top:20px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="logo">LOOV.</div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="title">Seu agendamento foi cancelado</div>
      <div class="sub">O estabelecimento precisou cancelar seu agendamento. Pedimos desculpas pelo inconveniente.</div>
      <div class="detail-row"><span class="detail-label">Estabelecimento</span><span class="detail-value"><%= @appointment.car_wash.name %></span></div>
      <div class="detail-row"><span class="detail-label">Serviço</span><span class="detail-value"><%= @appointment.service.title %></span></div>
      <div class="detail-row"><span class="detail-label">Data e horário</span><span class="detail-value"><%= @appointment.scheduled_at.in_time_zone("America/Sao_Paulo").strftime("%d/%m/%Y às %H:%M") %></span></div>
      <% if @appointment.cancellation_reason.present? %>
      <div class="reason-box">
        <div class="reason-label">Motivo informado</div>
        <%= @appointment.cancellation_reason %>
      </div>
      <% end %>
      <div style="text-align:center;">
        <a href="<%= car_washes_url %>" class="cta">Reagendar agora</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      Loov · Marketplace de lava-rápidos<br>
      Você recebeu este e-mail porque tinha um agendamento ativo.
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
